  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2503.04 Procedure for Granting a Medical Waiver",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2503.04 Procedure for Granting a Medical Waiver. Pursuant to RSA 266:61-a, the director shall waive the after market tinting restriction when:\n\n(a) Form DSMV 603 (Rev. 9/2025) is received by the director pursuant to the requirements of Saf-C 2503.03; and\n\n(b) The director reviews form DSMV 603 (Rev. 9/2025) and determines that:\n\n(1) The applicant has a medical condition set forth in Saf-C 2503.02; and\n\n(2) The requirements of Saf-C 2503.03 have been satisfied.\n\nSource. #4974, eff 11-13-90; ss by #6204, eff 3-15-96, EXPIRED: 3-15-04\n\nNew. #8072, eff 4-23-04; ss by #10083, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13416, eff 7-25-22; ss by #14218, INTERIM., eff 3-25-25; ss by #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
